    <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
         COLOUR PALETTE  —  93 tokens
         ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
         12 chromatic families × 7 slots  =  84
          1 grey family        × 7 slots  =   7
          2 absolutes (white + black)      =   2
         ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
         Slot → Material Design level:
           cl = 50    custom light   barely-there tint
           xl = 100   extra light    very light surface
           lt = 300   light          light accent
           nd = 500   normal         standard reference
           dk = 700   dark           strong accent / readable text
           xd = 800   extra dark     primary actions
           cd = 900   custom dark    deepest shade
         ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->

